+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+--
+-- File: InputSERDES.vhd
+-- Author: Elod Gyorgy
+-- Original Project: HDMI input on 7-series Xilinx FPGA
+-- Date: 8 October 2014
+--
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+-- (c) 2014 Copyright Digilent Incorporated
